293
00:22:46,353 --> 00:22:50,480
don't need one thing to do

294
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:56,437
I want to be strong and

295
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:59,157
strong I want to be a

296
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:02,220
